OL,3,GNEWSADrought devastation: How to
OL,4,Aprotect London's trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn The Closes park in West Drayton, we
OL,7,Fare surrounded by withered saplings of
OL,8,Fnewly planted trees. It has been a bad
OL,9,Fsummer for the capital's trees - the
OL,10,Fchallenge is significant.
OL,12,FA recent report from the Greater London
OL,13,FAuthority (GLA) concluded that, if
OL,14,Fnothing changes, over 72% of London's
OL,15,Fcurrent public realm tree population
OL,16,Fwill struggle under future climatic
OL,17,Fconditions.
OL,19,FTrees are on the front line in the
OL,20,Ffight to combat man-made climate change
OL,21,Fin London.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
